olor=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合，并且下次释放主动技能时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 2-3十字 3纵居中.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4e/hjj9gsck336oxrx95rp1sqex5w01md5.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_2-3%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_3%E7%BA%B5%E5%B1%85%E4%B8%AD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4e/hjj9gsck336oxrx95rp1sqex5w01md5.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%8B%89%E7%BB%B4%E8%80%B6%E2%80%A2%E5%88%9D%E5%A4%8F%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86\" title=\"角色图鉴库/拉维耶•初夏记忆\"><img alt=\"头像 拉维耶•初夏记忆.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e5/dxcocc8x6nl7ckbewsb07kz9lhu51xy.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">拉维耶•初夏记忆</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-